---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Hacker News 中文早报
description: 每日 Hacker News Top 30 中文摘要、重点分类与独立博客精选。
permalink: /index.html
---
{% set posts = collections.digest | reverse %}
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Daily digest</p>
  <h1>Hacker News 中文早报</h1>
  <p>每天整理 Hacker News Top 30，并筛选 LLM / Agent、学习与阅读、写作与博客、独立博客等重点内容。</p>
</section>
{% if posts.length %}
<section class="latest-card">
  <p class="eyebrow">最新一期</p>
  <h2><a href="{{ posts[0].url | url }}">{{ posts[0].data.title }}</a></h2>
  <p>{{ posts[0].date | dateReadable }}</p>
  <p>{{ posts[0].data.description }}</p>
  <a class="button" href="{{ posts[0].url | url }}">阅读本期 →</a>
</section>
{% endif %}
<section class="archive-preview">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2>最近归档</h2><a href="{{ '/archive/' | url }}">查看全部</a></div>
  <ol class="archive-list">
  {% for post in posts %}
    {% if loop.index <= 8 %}
    <li><a href="{{ post.url | url }}"><time>{{ post.date | dateReadable }}</time><span>{{ post.data.title }}</span></a></li>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
